msgid "A timeless one-carat solitaire in a four-prong 18K white gold setting."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:60
msgid "Our signature engagement ring: a one-carat IGI-certified round brilliant diamond held high in a four-prong cathedral setting so it catches light from every angle. The 2 mm comfort-fit band is cast in 18K white gold and rhodium-finished for a lasting, mirror-bright shine. Free resizing within 60 days and lifetime exchange at full gold value."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:72
msgid "Rose Petal Halo Ring"
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:76
msgid "A blush pink sapphire framed by a halo of micro-pavé diamonds."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:77
msgid "Soft, romantic and quietly bold. A cushion-cut pink sapphire sits inside a halo of 18 micro-pavé diamonds, set on a slender 18K rose gold band with petal-shaped shoulders. Arrives in a gift box with its certificate."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:87
msgid "Royal Emerald Kundan Necklace"
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:93
msgid "A regal 22K kundan necklace with hand-set Zambian emerald drops."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:94
msgid "Inspired by Mughal court jewellery and hand-set by our karigars in Jaipur using traditional kundan technique. Seven Zambian emerald drops hang from a 22K gold collar finished with meenakari enamel on the reverse — an heirloom for weddings and festive evenings."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:103
msgid "Pearl Drop Jhumka Earrings"
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:107
msgid "Light gold jhumkas finished with lustrous freshwater pearls."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:108
msgid "Classic bell-shaped jhumkas in 22K gold with a delicate granulation border and a single freshwater pearl drop. Light enough to wear from the morning puja to the evening sangeet."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:116
msgid "Sapphire Teardrop Pendant"
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:120
msgid "A deep blue Ceylon sapphire framed with diamonds, on an 18-inch chain."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:121
msgid "A 1.2-carat teardrop Ceylon sapphire surrounded by a pavé diamond frame in 18K white gold. Comes with a matching 18-inch box chain and a GIA gemstone report."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:129
msgid "Celestial Diamond Tennis Bracelet"
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:134
msgid "Thirty-four brilliant diamonds in a fluid line of 18K white gold."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:135
msgid "An everyday icon: 3 carats of matched round brilliant diamonds set in four-prong links that move like silk. Double safety clasp and complimentary annual cleaning."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:143
msgid "Linen Wrap Dress"
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:149
msgid "A breezy midi wrap dress in washed European linen."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:150
msgid "Cut from pre-washed European linen that softens with every wear. The wrap front and self-tie belt flatter every shape, and deep side pockets make it the dress you will reach for all summer. Machine washable."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:160
msgid "Classic Leather Sneakers"
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:164
msgid "Minimal white leather sneakers with a cushioned, recycled sole."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:165
msgid "Full-grain leather uppers, a padded collar and a recycled rubber cupsole make these the sneakers that go with everything. Leather-lined for all-day comfort."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:173
msgid "Structured Leather Tote"
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:178
msgid "A roomy tan tote that fits a 14-inch laptop and then some."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:179
msgid "Vegetable-tanned leather, hand-stitched edges and a brass turn-lock pocket. It holds a 14-inch laptop, a water bottle and everything else your day needs, and ages beautifully."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:187
msgid "Organic Cotton Tee"
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:191
msgid "A heavyweight organic cotton T-shirt that keeps its shape."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:192
msgid "220 gsm GOTS-certified organic cotton, garment-dyed for a lived-in feel. Relaxed fit, reinforced neckline and made in Tiruppur."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:205
msgid "Aura ANC Headphones"
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:211
msgid "Adaptive noise cancelling, 40-hour battery and plush memory-foam cushions."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:212
msgid "Hybrid active noise cancellation tunes itself to your surroundings, while 40 mm drivers deliver warm, detailed sound. Forty hours of battery, 10-minute fast charge for 5 hours, multipoint Bluetooth 5.3 and a foldable design. One-year warranty."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:222
msgid "Pulse Smartwatch"
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:226
msgid "AMOLED fitness watch with SpO2, sleep tracking and 10-day battery."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:227
msgid "A 1.43-inch always-on AMOLED display, 100+ workout modes, heart-rate, SpO2 and sleep tracking, Bluetooth calling and up to 10 days on a charge. Swim-proof to 5 ATM."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:236
msgid "Nova Bluetooth Speaker"
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:241
msgid "360° room-filling sound, IPX7 waterproof, 18-hour battery."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:242
msgid "Dual passive radiators and a 360° driver fill any room or terrace with rich, balanced sound. IPX7 waterproof, pairs with a second speaker for stereo, and lasts 18 hours per charge."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:250
msgid "Echo Wireless Earbuds"
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:254
msgid "Pocket-size ANC earbuds with a 32-hour charging case."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:255
msgid "Active noise cancellation, four microphones for clear calls, low-latency game mode and a slim case that adds 26 hours of listening. USB-C and wireless charging."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:263
msgid "Vitamin C Glow Serum"
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:269
msgid "15% vitamin C with ferulic acid for brighter, even skin."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:270
msgid "A stable 15% L-ascorbic acid serum with vitamin E and ferulic acid to fade dark spots and protect against pollution. Fragrance-free, dermatologist tested and suitable for Indian skin tones. 30 ml."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:279
msgid "Velvet Matte Lipstick"
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:283
msgid "Weightless, transfer-resistant matte colour that stays for 12 hours."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:284
msgid "A creamy bullet that sets to a soft velvet matte. Enriched with shea butter and vitamin E so lips never feel dry. Vegan and cruelty-free."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:297
msgid "Rosé Hydration Cream"
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:301
msgid "A cushiony moisturiser with Kannauj rose water and ceramides."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:302
msgid "Steam-distilled rose water from Kannauj, three ceramides and hyaluronic acid restore the skin barrier and keep it plump for 48 hours. Non-greasy and perfect under make-up. 50 g."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:307
msgid "Oud Eau de Parfum"
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:312
msgid "Smoky oud, Bulgarian rose and saffron in a long-lasting parfum."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:313
msgid "An evening fragrance built around Assam oud, softened by Bulgarian rose and warmed with saffron and amber. Eau de parfum concentration for 8–10 hours of wear. 50 ml."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:321
msgid "Wild Forest Honey"
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:326
msgid "Raw, unprocessed multi-flora honey from the Nilgiri forests."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:327
msgid "Collected by tribal honey gatherers in the Nilgiri Biosphere and simply strained — never heated or blended — so every enzyme and floral note survives. Natural crystallisation is a sign of purity. 500 g glass jar."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:336
msgid "Himalayan Green Tea"
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:340
msgid "Whole-leaf first-flush green tea from a single Darjeeling estate."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:341
msgid "Hand-plucked in spring and pan-fired the same day for a sweet, grassy cup with a gentle muscatel finish. Brews up to three times. 100 g in a reusable tin."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:349
msgid "Cold-Pressed Olive Oil"
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:354
msgid "Extra virgin, single-origin and first cold pressed. 500 ml."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:355
msgid "Pressed within hours of harvest from a single grove of Arbequina olives, with low acidity and a peppery, green finish. Ideal for salads, dips and finishing dishes."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:363
msgid "Superfood Trail Mix"
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:367
msgid "Roasted almonds, cashews, cranberries and seeds with no added sugar."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:368
msgid "A crunchy, protein-rich mix of dry-roasted almonds and cashews, pumpkin and sunflower seeds, cranberries and golden raisins. No added sugar, no palm oil. 400 g resealable jar."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:373
msgid "Terracotta Table Lamp"
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:379
msgid "Hand-thrown terracotta base with a pleated linen shade."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:380
msgid "Thrown by potters in Khurja and fired twice for a warm, earthy glow. The pleated linen shade softens the light for bedside or living-room corners. E27 holder; bulb not included."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:389
msgid "Celadon Ceramic Vase"
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:393
msgid "A sculptural stoneware vase with a soft celadon glaze."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:394
msgid "Each vase is wheel-thrown and glazed by hand, so no two are alike. Watertight for fresh flowers and beautiful on its own with dried stems."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:402
msgid "Handloom Cushion Cover"
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:407
msgid "Handwoven cotton cushion cover with gold and forest stripes."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:408
msgid "Woven on pit looms in Panipat from soft cotton yarn, with a hidden zip and tassel corners. 45 × 45 cm; insert not included."
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:416
msgid "Sandalwood Soy Candle"
msgstr ""

#: includes/demo/data.php:420
msgid "Mysore sandalwood and vetiver in a clean-burning soy candle."
